; Invalid: a render-pass that draws and names no `:pipeline`. WebGPU's draw
; calls are validated against the pass's current pipeline, and a pass that
; never called setPipeline fails at the first draw. `:pipeline` is optional
; on a render pass ONLY for a pass that replays bundles (`:execute-bundles`),
; which carry their own; a pass with a draw of its own needs the pipeline it
; runs under. This compiled to begin_render_pass → draw → end_pass until audit
; 09's prose sweep probed it.
(render-pass :name draw
  (color-attachment :view context-current-texture :clear-value [0 0 0 1] :load-op clear :store-op store)
  (draw :vertex-count 3))
(frame :name main :perform [draw])
